        ],
        "summary": "A company's income statement, balance sheet, or cash-flow statement for one fiscal period, sourced from structured SEC XBRL. Values use the latest restatement per line. Quarterly flow rows are discrete quarters; exact quarters derived from cumulative facts in one currency are marked derived.",
