        ],
        "summary": "Aggregate reported 13F exposure history for an exact stock or ETF listing across quarterly report dates,\noldest first. The legacy totalShares field sums common-share, put/call\nnotional-underlying, and any tracked principal-denominated rows, so it is not pure\nshare ownership. Non-ETF primary stocks use the combined view while the newest quarter's\nfiling window is open; ETF listings remain exact and as-filed because carry-forward is\nfiler-wide. Share totals are restated onto today's split basis before the change.",
        "parameters": [
