        "summary": "The curated superinvestor directory — well-known value investors and fund managers, each with their 13F filer CIK, latest published tracked portfolio value, position count, quarter-over-quarter change, and report date. Values normally use report-date closing prices, may fall back to filer values, and can be zero when unavailable. Use the CIK with the institution endpoints for a manager's full holdings.",
