      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Multiples"
        ],
        "summary": "A company's current valuation multiples (EV/Revenue, EV/EBIT, P/E on TTM figures) with a peer median, quartiles, and the actual sample count for each ratio. The subject is excluded from its own peers; similar-size industry peers are used when the industry holds enough of them, else the rest of the industry. Diluted EPS is published only when it reconciles to income and diluted weighted shares on one effective split basis. REITs also carry P/FFO and P/AFFO, and any filer with a verified reconciliation carries EV over its own stated Adjusted EBITDA, from the company's SEC-stated reconciliation.",
