        ],
        "summary": "The available option expiration dates for a stock, ascending, with the number of listed contracts at each. Use one of these as the `expiration` for the option chain. This endpoint returns dates and counts, not price quotes; an empty successful response means the stock has no listed options, while an unavailable feed returns 503.",
