        ],
        "summary": "Stochastic oscillator (%K and its %D smoothing) over a stock's daily bars, newest first. Extra look-back bars are fetched before the window so in-range points are fully computed; values are null only when the stock's history itself is shorter than the lookback. On the Free plan a session's bars are released 4 hours after the market close.",
