              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HolderActivityDto"
            },
            "description": "Buyers and sellers are compared like-for-like: only filers with an observed 13F in both quarters rank, so a late filer, a first filer or a fund that stopped filing under its CIK is never read as a trade. A filer that continues under one new CIK is compared through it (continuesFrom); one split across several new CIKs is left out.",
            "nullable": true
          },
          "sellers": {
