            "description": "True only when bidPrice or askPrice comes from the indicative feed. Trades on that\n            feed are 15-minute delayed, while quotes are modified indicative values rather than delayed\n            OPRA BBO. This does not describe the daily snapshot; use snapshotDate for that."
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
