            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "True when this listing's stored daily price history is confirmed restated onto the\n            post-split basis, so bars on both sides of the split compare directly. False when the split\n            is not effective yet, its restatement is pending, or the restatement cannot be confirmed\n            (a ratio strictly between 1:2 and 2:1). False never proves that earlier bars are on the old basis;\n            treat the effective date as a break in the series."
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "One captured stock split for an exact listing. The ratio is numerator new shares for\n            every denominator old shares: 10 and 1 is a 10-for-1 forward split, 1 and 20 a 1-for-20\n            reverse split."
